            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "ZzXc7",
              "x": 41,
              "y": 113,
              "name": "Fitz succeeded in his dangerous mission as the king's assassin, but it came at a terrible cost. Having miraculously survived a poisoning attempt, he vowed never to return to the king's service. But love and cruel circumstances draw him back to Buckkeep, to the court of the aging and ailing King Shrewd, into a sinister web of intrigue, and into a war with the enemies of the Six Duchies that is flaring up with renewed vigor.",
              "fill": "#000000ff",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width-height",
              "width": 866,
              "height": 174,
              "content": "Fitz succeeded in his dangerous mission as the king's assassin, but it came at a terrible cost. Having miraculously survived a poisoning attempt, he vowed never to return to the king's service. But love and cruel circumstances draw him back to Buckkeep, to the court of the aging and ailing King Shrewd, into a sinister web of intrigue, and into a war with the enemies of the Six Duchies that is flaring up with renewed vigor.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
